WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.660
A kɔn tɔ th'ɔ payroll voucher dip-dayv.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:08.220
Bifo SaloneHCM, branch dɛn bin de email spreadsheet ɔ de kɛr pepa voucher go headquarters.

3
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:16.623
Naw, ɛvri branch de submit insay wan sɛntral dijital repository, ɛn ɛvri voucher de pas strict approval chain bifo wan singul leone muv.

4
00:00:16.623 --> 00:00:18.106
Mek wi waka di ful jɔni.

5
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:31.356
Dis na di sɛntral repository. Di indiketa kad dɛn de sho aw mɛni branch dɛn dɔn submit dis period, wetin de wet supervisor sign-off, wetin de insay finance review, ɛn wetin dɔn authorise fɔ payment.

6
00:00:31.356 --> 00:00:35.330
Filta dɛn kin mek yu slays bay period, branch, ɛn workflow stage.

7
00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:11.033
Opin ɛni voucher ɛn yu de si di ful stori: ɛvri employee layn wit gross pay, PAYE, NASSIT, lon dɛdɔkshɔn dɛn ɛn net pay; di total dɛn; ɛn di komplit audit taymlɛyn — udat krayt am, udat apruv am, ɛn ɛgzaktli wɛntɛm.

8
00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:12.936
Wɛn dɛn submit, voucher de frɔz.

9
00:01:12.936 --> 00:01:15.314
Nobɔdi nɔ kin chɛnj nɔmba kwayet-kwayet.

10
00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:18.616
Di workflow de ɛnfos fɔ ay fɔ minimum.

11
00:01:18.616 --> 00:01:22.104
Branch officer de submit. Di branch supervisor de apruv.

12
00:01:22.104 --> 00:01:29.016
Finance officer de rivyu ɛn apruv — ɛn di sistem de fizikal blok ɛnibɔdi frɔm apruvɛn voucher we dɛn sɛf krayt.

13
00:01:29.016 --> 00:01:36.925
Las wan, Ministry of Finance approver de authorise payment — ɛn da pɔsin fɔ difrɛnt frɔm di kraytor ɛn di finance approver bɔt.

14
00:01:36.925 --> 00:01:39.914
Dual kɔntrɔl, we di sɔftwe de ɛnfos, nɔto trɔst.

15
00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:49.711
Mistek dɛn kin apin. Insted fɔ ɛdit insay ples, reviewer de ritɔn di voucher wit ritin risin — at list tɛn kɛrakta, ɔltɛm dɛn de rikɔd am.

16
00:01:49.711 --> 00:01:54.493
Di branch de kɔrɛkt di figya dɛn, risubmit, ɛn di rivishɔn nɔmba de inkrimɛnt.

17
00:01:54.493 --> 00:01:56.394
Di kɔrɛkshɔn istri na pɛmanɛnt.

18
00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:03.624
Ɛn di kwayet protɛkshɔn dɛn: wan voucher pɔ branch pɔ period — dupliket dɛn de rijɛkt.

19
00:02:03.624 --> 00:02:08.560
Employee nɔ kin apia pan tu voucher insay di sem mɔnt — da na di dɔbul-pey gad.

20
00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:13.059
Ɛn wɛn dɛn authorise payment, di voucher de bi pɛmanɛnt immutable rikɔd.

21
00:02:13.059 --> 00:02:15.434
Na so payroll fraud lupol dɛn de kloz.

22
00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:21.473
Submit dijital, apruv insay chen, ritɔn wit risin dɛn, ɛn lɛt di rel dɛn du dɛn wok.

23
00:02:21.473 --> 00:02:25.514
Di voucher certification quiz de wet yu insay di Training Center.
